{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u9f99\u95e8Longmen",
    "steam_appid": 3773810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/081841a874e06fc1f9c7d49956df9eb7.avif?t=1750756210\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Yang Jian, three legendary Chinese mythological characters, face their destined opponents in life, whether they are gods or demons, and confront them head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/62193fcec1d2e314a16e918eb830aa38.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel style: Exquisite Q-version pixel painting style, awakening memories in the mind with a new style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike gameplay: With each new game, the map room is randomly generated: the positions of enemies, treasure chests, and events change, making every experience full of freshness for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skills: The game has many skills, but unlike many games, skills are randomly assigned to characters. Tell a secret: If only one character is selected, all those skills will only be assigned to one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/59a234c14efdcdd1c68e7ba607dd3a75.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fighter system of the game is not complicated at all, it is a relatively simple turn based card battle. No need to build, randomly select cards according to their type and level, easily tackle various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/ad694f2fe8923ade6c4b2211dae53ace.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/081841a874e06fc1f9c7d49956df9eb7.avif?t=1750756210\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Yang Jian, three legendary Chinese mythological characters, face their destined opponents in life, whether they are gods or demons, and confront them head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/62193fcec1d2e314a16e918eb830aa38.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel style: Exquisite Q-version pixel painting style, awakening memories in the mind with a new style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike gameplay: With each new game, the map room is randomly generated: the positions of enemies, treasure chests, and events change, making every experience full of freshness for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skills: The game has many skills, but unlike many games, skills are randomly assigned to characters. Tell a secret: If only one character is selected, all those skills will only be assigned to one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/59a234c14efdcdd1c68e7ba607dd3a75.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fighter system of the game is not complicated at all, it is a relatively simple turn based card battle. No need to build, randomly select cards according to their type and level, easily tackle various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/ad694f2fe8923ade6c4b2211dae53ace.avif?t=1750756210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Longmen&quot; is a roguelike turn-based card game set in Chinese mythology, where you can freely embody three legendary figures from the myths\u2014Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Erlang Shen\u2014challenging the lofty deities and their minions.",
